# Files under site/ that must NOT be uploaded as public assets.
# The assets directory is site/ itself, so anything here is served at https://<host>/<path> by default.
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# Wrangler's LOCAL emulation state (KV/D1/R2/cache) from `wrangler dev`. Measured 2026-09-27: without this
# line those files are read as assets and would be published to the edge.
.wrangler
